  --> tests/ui/index_non_collection_reported_once.jet:6:16
    |
  6 |     print(count["user"]["name"])
    |                ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Indexing needs a collection with a declared element or value type
 Fix: Use `[ ]` on a List or Map
